                <p class="wow animate__animated animate__fadeIn" data-wow-delay="0.3s" data-wow-duration="1s">Hi, I'm David Villaplana Gonzalez. Ever since I was a kid, I've been drawn to the world of technology, exploring all kinds of software and keeping up with new advancements. At the same time, I've always had a strong interest in design and creativity, so web development brought everything together into something I truly enjoy.</p>  
                <p class="wow animate__animated animate__fadeIn" data-wow-delay="0.6s" data-wow-duration="1s">I like building things that are practical and intuitive, without losing their visual appeal. I'm the kind of person who enjoys breaking problems down and finding solutions that feel simple and well put together.</p>  
                <p class="wow animate__animated animate__fadeIn" data-wow-delay="0.9s" data-wow-duration="1s">When a new idea comes to mind, I’m eager to bring it to life. I focus on understanding how it works, solving challenges along the way, refining the details to make sure everything feels clean and cohesive, while learning throughout the process both as a developer and as a person.</p>
                
